project workflow is the step-by-step process that guides how tasks move from start to finish. It helps organize the work, assign responsibilities, track progress, and complete the project efficiently.
Main steps:
Planning – Define goals, tasks, and resources.
Task Assignment – Assign responsibilities to team members.
Execution – Perform the planned tasks.
Monitoring – Track progress and solve problems.
Review – Check the quality and completion of work.
Completion – Deliver the final project and close the work.
